ds of the Coast, 12 Feb 2007."}},{"id":"maelstrom-e3","summary":"In Benalia, Pol Cordel tells Gerrard that a Talruum has arrived aboard a flying ship, and Gerrard guesses Sisay has come for him.","participants":["pol-cordel","gerrard-capashen","sisay"],"location":"benalia","importance":"minor","page":"stories/maelstrom","order":0,"story_date":"2007-02-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":18,"quote":"\"You think she's come looking for me.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom#:~:text=%22You%20think%20she%27s%20come%20looking%20for%20me.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Maelstrom","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael G. Ryan"],"date":"2007-02-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom#:~:text=%22You%20think%20she%27s%20come%20looking%20for%20me.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Maelstrom\" by Michael G. Ryan. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Feb 2007."}},{"id":"maelstrom-e7","summary":"Starke offers Maraxus the woman who knows where Gerrard is, claiming she can draw Gerrard from hiding, and Maraxus orders him to bring her.","participants":["starke","maraxus","sisay","gerrard-capashen"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/maelstrom","order":0,"story_date":"2007-02-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":41,"quote":"\"Bring her,\" it said suddenly.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom#:~:text=%22Bring%20her%2C%22%20it%20said%20suddenly.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Maelstrom","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael G. Ryan"],"date":"2007-02-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom#:~:text=%22Bring%20her%2C%22%20it%20said%20suddenly.","archived":null,"l