:text=This%20servant%2C%20Volrath%2C%20is%20holding%20Starke%27s%20daughter%20prisoner.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Maelstrom\" by Michael G. Ryan. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Feb 2007."}},{"id":"maelstrom-e13","summary":"Sisay predicts that Gerrard will never be free of the Legacy.","participants":["sisay","tahngarth","gerrard-capashen"],"location":"weatherlight","importance":"minor","page":"stories/maelstrom","order":0,"story_date":"2007-02-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":72,"quote":"He'll never be free of the Legacy. He just doesn't know it yet.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom#:~:text=He%27ll%20never%20be%20free,doesn%27t%20know%20it%20yet.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Maelstrom","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael G. Ryan"],"date":"2007-02-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom#:~:text=He%27ll%20never%20be%20free,doesn%27t%20know%20it%20yet.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Maelstrom\" by Michael G. Ryan. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Feb 2007."}},{"id":"maelstrom-e17","summary":"Starke betrays Sisay by opening a portal at Volrath's command, from which massive hands drag her away.","participants":["starke","sisay","volrath"],"location":"weatherlight","importance":"major","page":"stories/maelstrom","order":0,"story_date":"2007-02-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":91,"quote":"She was alone with the traitor, alone against Volrath's power, directed at her by Starke.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/maelstrom#:~:text=She%20was%20alone%20with,at%20her%20by%20Starke.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Maelstrom","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael G. Ryan"],"date":"2007-02-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/mag